  triage:title "boundaries/atm-peer-tls-interop/tls-interop.toml status.state=planned masks crate's own io_forbidden enforcement; thread::spawn present 3x in test harness" ;
  triage:description "The boundary manifest `boundaries/atm-peer-tls-interop/tls-interop.toml` has `status.state=planned`, which masks/suppresses the crate's own `io_forbidden` boundary enforcement from actually gating this crate in CI/boundary checks. Additionally, `thread::spawn` genuinely appears 3 times in the test harness for this crate, which should be scrutinized under whatever policy governs thread usage in test harnesses for this boundary." ;
